        "collapsible_tab_Qz7EyW": {
          "type": "collapsible_tab",
          "settings": {
            "heading": "Pure Shilajit Extract. Now in a Gummy.",
            "icon": "none",
            "content": "<p>Resin requires measuring and dissolving. Tablets require water. Gummies require nothing — two, any time of day, done.</p><ul><li>Pure shilajit extract — same source and altitude as the resin</li><li>Fulvic acid — verified by Certified Laboratories. The compound that makes shilajit worth taking in the first place, measured and on record.</li><li>85+ trace minerals naturally present in the extract</li><li>Plant-based — no gelatin, no corn syrup, no artificial anything</li><li>No preparation needed — two gummies, any time, anywhere</li></ul>",
            "page": ""
          }
        },
        "collapsible_tab_nXt8Qr": {
          "type": "collapsible_tab",
          "settings": {
            "heading": "What the Extract Contains",
            "icon": "none",
            "content": "<p>Gummy format changes nothing about what's inside. Pure Himalayan shilajit extract carries three things worth knowing about.</p><p>Fulvic acid — 639.73mg per serving, verified by Certified Laboratories. The compound that makes shilajit worth taking in the first place, measured and on record.</p><p>85+ trace minerals, naturally carried from the raw resin into every gummy. Not added back in. Present because they were never removed.</p><p>Dibenzo-α-Pyrones — the compounds authentic shilajit carries, preserved through the extraction process into every gummy.</p><p><strong>Shilajit Extract</strong><br/>Fulvic acid, 85+ trace minerals, Dibenzo-α-Pyrones — naturally present, nothing added</p><p><strong>Natural Sweeteners</strong><br/>Monk fruit extract — low calorie, plant-based, no artificial sweeteners</p><p><strong>Natural Colors and Flavors</strong><br/>Black carrot extract, beta-carotene, juice concentrates — clean label, nothing artificial</p>",
            "page": ""
          }
        },
        "collapsible_tab_krM7aT": {
          "type": "collapsible_tab",
          "settings": {
            "heading": "What's in Every Gummy. What Isn't.",
            "icon": "none",
            "content": "<p>Each serving contains 500mg of pure Himalayan shilajit extract across two gummies. Dibenzo-α-Pyrones naturally present. 85+ trace minerals naturally occurring.</p><p><strong>Gummy base: </strong>Juice Concentrate, Citric Acid, Monk Fruit Extract, Vegetable Juice Color from Black Carrot Extract, Beta-Carotene, Natural Flavors.</p><p><strong>Free from: </strong>No preservatives. No artificial colors. No artificial flavors. No gelatin. No corn syrup. No soy.</p><p><strong>Source: </strong>Everest Region, Nepal, above 18,000 ft<br/><br/><strong>Facility:</strong> SGS GMP Certified, Nepal Government Registered<br/><br/><strong>Testing: </strong>ISO/IEC 17025, Certified Laboratories</p><p>Full lab reports for this batch are available below.</p>",
            "page": ""
          }
        },
        "collapsible_tab_HphhfY": {
          "type": "collapsible_tab",
          "settings": {
            "heading": "Two Gummies. Any Time. Done.",
            "icon": "none",
            "content": "<p>Take 2 gummies once daily. No water required. No preparation. Morning works well for consistency — pick a time and keep it.</p><p>Do not exceed 2 gummies per day. Consistency matters more than quantity.</p><p>Consult a doctor before use if pregnant, nursing, or on any medication. Not intended for anyone under 18 years of age. Keep out of reach of children. Store in a cool, dry place away from direct sunlight.</p>",
            "page": ""
          }
        },
        "collapsible_tab_TgW7KD": {
          "type": "collapsible_tab",
