            "icon": "none",
            "content": "<p>Your order ships within <strong>1–2 business days</strong>. Delivery takes approximately <strong>4–7 days</strong> depending on your location. Once dispatched you will receive a tracking number and continuous updates. Track your order directly from our Track My Order page.</p>",
            "page": ""
