    "slider_with_banner_GLDwpC": {
      "type": "slider-with-banner",
      "blocks": {
        "slide_fFdGcG": {
          "type": "slide",
          "settings": {
            "tab_title": "Weeks 1 - 2",
            "slide_heading": "The Beginning",
            "slide_text": "<div class=\"h-max flex flex-col justify-center\">\n<p>Two gummies, same time, every day. The fulvic acid and 85+ trace minerals in these pure Himalayan shilajit gummies are being introduced to the system for the first time — same dose, same time, building from day one.\n</p>\n\n<p class=\"text-grey\">\nSome people notice a shift in how their mornings feel during this window. Others don't notice anything yet. Both are normal. The compounds are present. The process has started.\n</p>\n</div>"
          }
        },
        "slide_VUR3wa": {
          "type": "slide",
          "settings": {
            "tab_title": "Weeks 3 - 10",
            "slide_heading": "Where Most People Notice",
            "slide_text": "<div class=\"h-max flex flex-col justify-center\">\n<p>By this point the daily dose has had enough time to accumulate. Fulvic acid is working at the cellular level. Dibenzo-α-Pyrones are doing what they do in authentic shilajit. The 85+ trace minerals have been part of the system consistently, same amount, every single day.\n</p>\n<p class=\"text-grey\">\nThis is the period most customers reach out to us. Reports during this stretch tend to mention recovery and focus. Two Himalayan shilajit gummies a day, consistently, has been the only variable.\n</p>\n</div>"
          }
        },
        "slide_8E6BHW": {
          "type": "slide",
          "settings": {
            "tab_title": "Weeks 11+",
            "slide_heading": "When It Becomes Routine",
            "slide_text": "<div class=\"h-max flex flex-col justify-center\">\n<p>\nAt this point, the compounds in these pure shilajit gummies have been building consistently for over two months. Fulvic acid, trace minerals, Dibenzo-α-Pyrones — all delivered in the same precise dose, every single day.\n</p>\n<p class=\"text-grey\">\nMost people at this stage stop thinking about it. Two gummies is part of the day. The routine just works.\n</p>\n</div>"
          }
        }
      },
